# The host's build output must never enter the build context. Its
# project.assets.json records the absolute path of the NuGet folder that wrote
# it; copied in, it overwrites the one the in-container restore just produced,
# and the PUBLISH dies inside ResolvePackageAssets with a stack trace and no
# sentence. The restore succeeds, which is what makes it confusing.
**/bin/
**/obj/

.git/
.github/
spike/
*.md
